# Patterns relative to the build context root. Prefer **/ prefixes so nested
# paths match (Docker treats unanchored names like gitignore; bare ``data/``
# does not reliably exclude ``worldfoundry/data/...``).
#
# The current Dockerfile does not ``COPY . .`` yet; once it does, these rules
# keep large test fixtures / docs / plan trees out of the image context.
#
# Ignoring ``.git`` breaks setuptools-scm dynamic versioning from the build
# context — set SETUPTOOLS_SCM_PRETEND_VERSION when building from a dirty tree
# without a .git directory.

.git
.github
.codex
.codex/
.claude/
.agents/
.cursor/
.vscode/
.idea/

**/.env*
**/.envrc
**/.direnv/
**/credentials/*.secret
**/*.token
token

**/.mypy_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.runtime/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info/
**/.venv/
**/venv/

**/benchmark_results/
**/cache/
**/data/
**/model/
**/runs/
**/tmp/
**/inspatio_world_output/
**/worldfoundry_outputs/
**/*.log
**/*.out
**/*.err

**/node_modules/
docs/
docs/fumadocs/.next/
plan/
thirdparty/
worldfoundry/data/test_cases/

**/*.ckpt
**/*.gguf
**/*.mp4
**/*.mov
**/*.mkv
**/*.safetensors
**/*.tar
**/*.tar.gz
**/*.tgz
**/*.zip
